 settled, the yose was close to even. Opus 5.5's A1 lost nothing and kept the deficit at -2.4, but the earlier damage left too little to claw back, and the game ended at W+2."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "after.py applies one named move, removes captures and prints each group's liberties; libs.py prints group liberties; count.py counts territory on a pasted final board. All work on the current position or one move the player named, with no candidate looping, playouts or look-ahead.", "stop": false}}